Third-party programs in this folder

bt.py, bt.js, nb.py, nb.js, sn.py, sn.js and ns.py are copied unchanged from
hanabi1224/Programming-Language-Benchmarks (https://github.com/hanabi1224/Programming-Language-Benchmarks):
binarytrees 1.py and 1.js, nbody 2.py and 6.js, spectral-norm 8.py and 6.js, nsieve 2.py.
Most of them come from The Computer Language Benchmarks Game, under its revised BSD license (below);
the repository itself is under the MIT license (below).

fk.py, fk.js, mb.py, mb.js and ns.js are this project's own ports of bench/fk.c, bench/mbt.c and bench/ns.c.

